OL,3,GNEWSAMedicine rules not robust enough
OL,4,Asays minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo fully support Jersey's "emerging
OL,7,Flife sciences industry", drug
OL,8,Fregulations must be updated to ensure
OL,9,Fthey meet international standards, a
OL,10,Fminister has said.
OL,12,FHealth and social services minister Tom
OL,13,FBinet said work had started to develop
OL,14,F"enhanced" rules and bring them up to
OL,15,Finternational standards, including
OL,16,Fchanges to the 1978 Misuse of Drugs
OL,17,FLaw, and the duties of the chief
OL,18,Fpharmacist were also under review.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
