OL,3,GNEWSAMedicine rules not robust enough
OL,4,Asays minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said reform was "necessary,
OL,7,Fproportionate, and timely" as the
OL,8,Freview found the regulations were "not
OL,9,Fsufficiently robust".
OL,11,FBinet was responding to a written
OL,12,Fquestion from nurse and former health
OL,13,Fminister deputy Karen Wilson.
